<title>USA: Retirement Care Jun 30 Q4 shr loss $0.03.</title>
<headline>Retirement Care Jun 30 Q4 shr loss $0.03.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr     loss    $0.03	  profit  $0.03</p>
<p> Net     loss    477	    profit  344</p>
<p> Revs		39,898		   23,662</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  14,179		   12,623</p>
<p>	   12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.38		    $0.38</p>
<p> Net		 5,453		    5,059</p>
<p> Revs		135,980		  80,274</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  13,586		   12,617</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers) Full company name is Retirement Care Associates Inc.</p>
<p>NOTE: The data is adjusted for five percent stock dividends issued in February 1995 and May 1996.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the loss was due to expenses associated with establishing a $1.18 million reserve for workmen's compensation insurance, health insurance and Medicare and Medicaid receivables.</p>
